1. 35% to the Community Reinvestment and Repair Fund under § 1-322 of the Alcoholic Beverages and Cannabis Article for fiscal years 2024 through 2033;
2. 5% to counties, which shall be allocated to each county based on the percentage of revenue collected from that county, except that a county shall distribute to a municipality located in the county 50% of the allocation received under this item that is attributable to the sales and use tax revenue generated by a dispensary located in that municipality;
